OL,3,GNEWSAWinter Pride cancelled after low
OL,4,Aticket sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Winter Pride in East Sussex has been
OL,7,Fcalled off after "significantly lower
OL,8,Fthan expected ticket sales", according
OL,9,Fto organisers.
OL,11,FThose behind the LGBT+ celebration,
OL,12,Fwhich was due to happen on 30 January
OL,13,Fin Eastbourne, said the "difficult
OL,14,Fdecision" was taken after much
OL,15,Fconsideration.
OL,17,F"We have a responsibility to use our
OL,18,Fresources wisely, and in the current
OL,19,Feconomic climate we cannot justify
OL,20,Finvesting thousands of pounds into an
OL,21,Fevent that simply isn't attracting the
OL,22,Fsupport it needs," said organisers.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
